# Binary deliverables must never pass through line-ending conversion.
#
# A ReportLab PDF can have no NUL byte in its first 8 KB, so git's heuristic
# classifies it as text, and core.autocrlf will then rewrite CRLF byte pairs
# inside its compressed streams. The file still has a .pdf extension but no
# longer opens. Declaring these binary makes git store and restore them byte for
# byte.

*.pdf   binary
*.pptx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary
*.db    binary
